msgid ""
"<h3>Help</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Use field <code>base</code> for using base salary of the Employee</li>\n"
"<li>Use Salary Component abbreviations in conditions and formulas. <code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\n"
"<li>Use field name for employee details in conditions and formulas. <code>Employment Type = employment_type</code><code>Branch = branch</code></li>\n"
"<li>Use field name from Salary Slip in conditions and formulas. <code>Payment Days = payment_days</code><code>Leave without pay = leave_without_pay</code></li>\n"
"<li>Direct Amount can also be entered based on Condition. See example 3</li></ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Calculating Basic Salary based on <code>base</code>\n"
"<pre><code>Condition: base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: base * .2</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calculating HRA based on Basic Salary<code>BS</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition: BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calculating TDS based on Employment Type<code>employment_type</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition: employment_type==\"Intern\"</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Amount: 1000</code></pre></li>\n"
"</ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Hjälp</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Anmärkningar:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Använd fältet <code>base</code> för att använda den anställdes grundlön</li>\n"
"<li>Använd lönekomponenternas förkortningar i villkor och formler. <code>BS = Grundlön</code></li>\n"
"<li>Använd fältnamn för uppgifter om anställd i villkor och formler. <code>Anställningstyp = employment_type</code><code>Filial = branch</code></li>\n"
"<li>Använd fältnamn från lönespecifikationen i villkor och formler. <code>Lönedagar = payment_days</code><code>Obetald ledighet = leave_without_pay</code></li>\n"
"<li>Belopp kan också anges direkt baserat på villkor. Se exempel 3</li></ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Exempel</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Beräkna grundlön baserat på <code>base</code>\n"
"<pre><code>Villkor: base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formel: base * .2</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Beräkna HRA baserat på grundlön<code>BS</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Villkor: BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formel: BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Beräkna TDS baserat på anställningstyp<code>employment_type</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Villkor: employment_type==\"Intern\"</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Belopp: 1000</code></pre></li>\n"
"</ol>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Condition Examples</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Applying tax if employee born between 31-12-1937 and 01-01-1958 (Employees aged 60 to 80)<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Applying tax by employee gender<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: gender==\"Male\"</code></li><br>\n"
"<li>Applying tax by Salary Component<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Villkorsexempel</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Tillämpa skatt om anställd är född mellan 1937-12-31 och 1958-01-01 (anställda i åldern 60 till 80)<br>\n"
"<code>Villkor: date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Tillämpa skatt efter den anställdes kön<br>\n"
"<code>Villkor: gender==\"Male\"</code></li><br>\n"
"<li>Tillämpa skatt efter lönekomponent<br>\n"
"<code>Villkor: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"

